WEBVTT

00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:11.970
Pull to refresh lets the people who use
your app reload a page by pulling it

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:17.970
down from the top. When they let go,
a refresh indicator appears and the

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:19.590
page loads the latest data.

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:26.930
On Android, the indicator slides down
over the page in the same way as in other

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:32.770
Android apps. On iOS, the page
moves down to show the indicator,

00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:34.770
which is what iPhone users expect.

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:41.430
You can keep the default indicator of each
platform, or you can use your own Lottie

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:47.010
animation. Your animation keeps
its own shape, so it does not look

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:48.670
stretched on either platform.

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:58.420
To turn on pull to refresh, open the app
configuration file and set pull to refresh

00:00:58.420 --> 00:01:04.240
to true. This one setting turns
on pull to refresh for every

00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:10.160
page in your app. To use your own
animation, upload the Lottie file

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:14.880
to the Files folder in your resources
and add its path as the pull to refresh

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:20.520
source. If you do not add a
source, the app uses the default

00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:22.060
indicator of each platform.

00:01:24.030 --> 00:01:29.370
Next, in the markup of the page, add
the on pull to refresh event to the page

00:01:29.370 --> 00:01:34.310
content. And in the event script, invoke
the variables that you want to reload.

00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:41.310
The event runs every time a user pulls the
page, and the page shows the new data as

00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:42.890
soon as the variables respond.

00:01:47.490 --> 00:01:52.770
To turn off pull to refresh on one page,
set pull to refresh to false on the page

00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:54.950
content in the markup of that page.

00:01:56.830 --> 00:02:02.030
The app setting controls every page, so
when it is off, no page can turn pull to

00:02:02.030 --> 00:02:07.430
refresh on. With pull to refresh,
the people who use your app

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:09.190
always see the latest data.
